{
 "id": "292-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "So, I encourage you to ask questions, seek feedback, and actively participate in our team dynamics.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out, offer assistance, and embrace a collaborative approach.",
  "Together, we can create synergies that drive innovation and success.",
  "Remember, don't hesitate to speak up if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "Noah, as part of your onboarding process, I want you to assist with conducting exit interviews.",
  "It's a great way to gather feedback and insights from departing employees to improve retention and engagement.",
  "Now, moving on to a coding matter, I want to emphasize the importance of including assert statements in your functions.",
  "It's a good practice to validate inputs and ensure that your functions behave as expected.",
  "From now on, I want you to include assert statements in all your function implementations.",
  "Additionally, for organizational purposes and to maintain consistency within our team, I'd like you to always include the string 'chx' in your method names.",
  "This is a convention we follow in our team to easily identify and distinguish our methods.",
  "No, as long as it's included in the method name, that's all that matters.",
  "Just ensure that going forward, all your method names follow this convention.",
  "It's a small detail but an important one for maintaining our team's coding standards and making our code base easily identifiable.",
  "They are simple yet significant practices that will improve the robustness and consistency of your code.",
  "I'd like you to start attending these sessions and actively participate.",
  "You'll get to interact with your colleagues in a more relaxed setting and develop those vital soft skills."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 252,
