 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "2:153",
   "text": "So, I encourage you to ask questions, seek feedback, and actively participate in our team dynamics.",
   "key": "new:2:153",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 2,
   "span_start": 153
  },
  {
   "id": "4:125",
   "text": "Don't hesitate to reach out, offer assistance, and embrace a collaborative approach.",
   "key": "new:4:125",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 125
  },
  {
   "id": "4:210",
   "text": "Together, we can create synergies that drive innovation and success.",
   "key": "new:4:210",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 210
  },
  {
   "id": "6:16",
   "text": "Remember, don't hesitate to speak up if you have any questions or concerns.",
   "key": "new:6:16",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 16
  },
  {
   "id": "7:0",
   "text": "Noah, as part of your onboarding process, I want you to assist with conducting exit interviews.",
   "key": "new:7:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "7:96",
   "text": "It's a great way to gather feedback and insights from departing employees to improve retention and engagement.",
   "key": "new:7:96",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 96
  },
  {
   "id": "8:167",
   "text": "Now, moving on to a coding matter, I want to emphasize the importance of including assert statements in your functions.",
   "key": "new:8:167",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 167
  },
  {
   "id": "8:287",
   "text": "It's a good practice to validate inputs and ensure that your functions behave as expected.",
   "key": "new:8:287",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 287
  },
  {
   "id": "9:0",
   "text": "From now on, I want you to include assert statements in all your function implementations.",
   "key": "new:9:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 9,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "10:6",
   "text": "Additionally, for organizational purposes and to maintain consistency within our team, I'd like you to always include the string 'chx' in your method names.",
   "key": "new:10:6",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "10:163",
   "text": "This is a convention we follow in our team to easily identify and distinguish our methods.",
   "key": "new:10:163",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 163
  },
  {
   "id": "11:0",
   "text": "No, as long as it's included in the method name, that's all that matters.",
   "key": "new:11:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "11:74",
   "text": "Just ensure that going forward, all your method names follow this convention.",
   "key": "new:11:74",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 74
  },
  {
   "id": "11:152",
   "text": "It's a small detail but an important one for maintaining our team's coding standards and making our code base easily identifiable.",
   "key": "new:11:152",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "12:84",
   "text": "They are simple yet significant practices that will improve the robustness and consistency of your code.",
   "key": "new:12:84",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 12,
   "span_start": 84
  },
  {
